<title>USA: CCC buys 380 tonnes US wheat-soy blend for Iraq.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 380 tonnes US wheat-soy blend for Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said on Thursday it had purchased 380 tonnes of U.S. wheat-soy blend for export to Iraq, November 25-December 10 shipment.</p>
<p>ADM Milling Co sold the blend for $442.35 per tonne, FOB Jacintoport, Texas.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
